page('privacy','Privacy Policy | FocusLock','How FocusLock handles your data: what stays on your device, permissions, ads, and Premium payment checks.','''
<section><div class="w prose"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Items marked [CONFIG] depend on your setup and should be reviewed before launch.</p>
<h2>Information collected</h2><p>FocusLock stores your app limits, usage statistics, goals, streaks and settings in a local database on your device. There is no account.</p>
<h2>Information not collected</h2><p>FocusLock does not read your messages, passwords or keystrokes, and does not upload your usage history to its own servers. Analytics collection is turned off in the app.</p>
<h2>Android permissions</h2><p>Usage access, Accessibility, Display over other apps, Notifications, optional Do Not Disturb, and Internet. See the <a href="download.html">download page</a> for what each is used for.</p>
<h2>App usage and accessibility data</h2><p>The Accessibility service is used to detect which app is in the foreground so the block screen can appear.</p>
<h2>Local storage and backups</h2><p>Data stays on your device. If you export a backup, the file is saved where you choose.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2><p>The free version shows ads from Adsterra in embedded web views. Adsterra may collect data under its own policy. Premium removes ads. [CONFIG: confirm ad partners]</p>
<h2>Premium and payment information</h2><p>Payments are made in Binance Pay. When you submit a transaction ID, the app checks it with Binance. FocusLock does not receive your Binance login. Premium expiry and used transaction IDs are stored on your device.</p>
<h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Adsterra (ads) and Binance (payment checks).</p>
<h2>Data security</h2><p>Data is kept on your device and protected by Android. No method is completely secure.</p>
<h2>Children's privacy</h2><p>FocusLock is not directed to children under 13. [CONFIG: review for your region]</p>
<h2>Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy and will change the date below.</p><p>Last updated: <span data-cfg="date"></span></p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p><a data-mail href="about.html#contact"><span data-cfg="email"></span></a></p></div></section>''')
